OL,3,AGreen member behind Zionism motion
OL,4,Anamed as 'close friend' of jailed
OL,5,Aal-Qaeda supporter in court
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Green Party member behind a motion
OL,8,Fwhich declared Zionism to be racism was
OL,9,Fnamed in court documents as a "close
OL,10,Ffriend" of a man who was jailed after
OL,11,Fbeing accused of plotting a suicide
OL,12,Fbomb attack at Heathrow Airport.
OL,14,FLubna Speitan, a British-Palestinian
OL,15,Fartist, proposed the Green conference
OL,16,Fmotion defining Zionism as an ideology
OL,17,Fsupporting "an ethnonationalist Jewish
OL,18,Fstate".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
