OL,3,AGreen member behind Zionism motion
OL,4,Anamed as 'close friend' of jailed
OL,5,Aal-Qaeda supporter in court
OL,6,
OL,7,FCourt documents from 2015 show she
OL,8,Foffered to testify as a defence witness
OL,9,Fin the trial of Minh Quang Pham, who
OL,10,Fwas jailed for 40 years in the US after
OL,11,Fpleading guilty to supporting al-Qaeda.
OL,12,FHe denied planning a suicide attack.
OL,14,FThe BBC has contacted Speitan for
OL,15,Fcomment. The Green Party said she holds
OL,16,Fno official positions and the party
OL,17,F"takes all allegations of this nature
OL,18,Fseriously".
